{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26943","headline":"和厉玄侍御题户部李相公庐山西林草堂 · 姚合","name":"和厉玄侍御题户部李相公庐山西林草堂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"茅屋临江起，登庸复应期。\n遥知归去日，自致太平时。\n幽药禅僧护，高窗宿鸟窥。\n行人尽歌咏，唯子独能诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26943.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26943","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}